{"id":"grading_precip_24h_light","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：小雨","content":"24小时降水量在 0.1～9.9 毫米之间为小雨。地面持续湿润，但很少有积水。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","农业"],"keywords":["小雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29","url":"http://openstd.samr.gov.cn/bzgk/gb/newGbInfo?hcno=B6CB35A0BC1F8D33CF0A18F95D0A8AB6"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_moderate","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：中雨","content":"24小时降水量在 10.0～24.9 毫米之间为中雨。雨势较密，已可形成明显地面径流。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","农业"],"keywords":["中雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_heavy","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：大雨","content":"24小时降水量在 25.0～49.9 毫米之间为大雨。雨势猛烈，能见度明显下降，地面易积水。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","农业","防汛"],"keywords":["大雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：暴雨","content":"24小时降水量在 50.0～99.9 毫米之间为暴雨。可能引发城市内涝、山洪、滑坡等次生灾害。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","防汛","应急"],"keywords":["暴雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_heavy_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：大暴雨","content":"24小时降水量在 100.0～249.9 毫米之间为大暴雨。极易引发严重灾害，应启动相应应急响应。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工","防汛","应急"],"keywords":["大暴雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_24h_extreme_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"24小时降水量：特大暴雨","content":"24小时降水量 ≥ 250.0 毫米为特大暴雨，属极端事件，可能造成重大灾害。","time_window":"24h","applicable_scene":["防汛","应急"],"keywords":["特大暴雨","24小时降水量","降水分级","mm"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_light","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：小雨","content":"12小时降水量 0.1～4.9 毫米为小雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工"],"keywords":["小雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_moderate","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：中雨","content":"12小时降水量 5.0～14.9 毫米为中雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工"],"keywords":["中雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_heavy","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：大雨","content":"12小时降水量 15.0～29.9 毫米为大雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","施工"],"keywords":["大雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_precip_12h_rainstorm","category":"grading_standard","topic":"降水等级","region":"CN","title":"12小时降水量：暴雨","content":"12小时降水量 30.0～69.9 毫米为暴雨。","time_window":"12h","applicable_scene":["出行","防汛"],"keywords":["暴雨","12小时降水量"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"降水量等级（GB/T 28592-2012）","clause":"4.1","publish_date":"2012-06-29"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_0","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 0 级：无风","content":"风速 0.0–0.2 m/s（< 1 km/h）。烟直上，海面平静。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","0级","无风","calm"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"0"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.1.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_1","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 1 级：软风","content":"风速 0.3–1.5 m/s（1–5 km/h）。烟能表示风向，但风向标不能转动。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","1级","软风","light air"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"1"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_2","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 2 级：轻风","content":"风速 1.6–3.3 m/s（6–11 km/h）。脸面感觉有风，树叶有微响，普通风向标转动。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","2级","轻风","light breeze"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"2"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_3","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 3 级：微风","content":"风速 3.4–5.4 m/s（12–19 km/h）。树叶及小树枝摇动不息，旌旗展开。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","3级","微风","gentle breeze"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"3"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_4","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 4 级：和风","content":"风速 5.5–7.9 m/s（20–28 km/h）。能吹起地面尘土与碎纸；小树枝摇动；水面起小波。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","4级","和风","moderate breeze"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"4"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_5","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 5 级：清劲风","content":"风速 8.0–10.7 m/s（29–38 km/h）。有叶的小树整株摇动，水面起波纹。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","5级","清劲风","fresh breeze"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"5"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_6","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 6 级：强风","content":"风速 10.8–13.8 m/s（39–49 km/h）。大树枝摇摆，电线呼啸，撑伞困难；高空作业、塔吊起吊须警惕。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","高空作业","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","6级","强风","strong breeze"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"6"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_7","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 7 级：疾风","content":"风速 13.9–17.1 m/s（50–61 km/h）。整树摇动，迎风步行困难；多数室外高空作业应停止。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","高空作业","户外"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","7级","疾风","near gale"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"7"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_8","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 8 级：大风","content":"风速 17.2–20.7 m/s（62–74 km/h）。小枝折断，逆风行进很困难；脚手架、塔吊、高空作业必须停止。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","高空作业"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","8级","大风","gale"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"8"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_9","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 9 级：烈风","content":"风速 20.8–24.4 m/s（75–88 km/h）。建筑物轻微损坏（如烟囱顶盖、屋瓦移动）；高空作业、塔吊起吊必须停止，户外作业人员应撤离至安全区。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","高空作业","应急"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","9级","烈风","strong gale"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"9"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_10","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 10 级：狂风","content":"风速 24.5–28.4 m/s（89–102 km/h）。可拔起树木，建筑物有相当大破坏；属严重危险天气。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","应急"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","10级","狂风","storm"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"10"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_11","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 11 级：暴风","content":"风速 28.5–32.6 m/s（103–117 km/h）。陆上很少见，可造成普遍严重破坏；非应急人员应避免外出，沿海航行船只须紧急避风。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","施工","应急"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","11级","暴风","violent storm"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"11"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_wind_beaufort_12","category":"grading_standard","topic":"风力等级","region":"WMO","title":"蒲福风级 12 级：飓风","content":"风速 ≥32.7 m/s（≥118 km/h）。陆上极少见，破坏力极大，可能造成大范围灾害；属最高级别危险天气，须执行最高级别应急响应。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","应急"],"keywords":["蒲福风级","12级","飓风","hurricane"],"source":{"org":"WMO","doc_title":"Beaufort wind force scale","clause":"12"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.0.0"}
{"id":"grading_visibility_haze","category":"grading_standard","topic":"能见度等级","region":"CN","title":"能见度：雾与霾","content":"按 GB/T 27964-2011《雾的预报等级》：水平能见度 500–1000 m 为雾；50–500 m 为浓雾；< 50 m 为强浓雾（能见度不足 500 m 的雾通常统称'大雾'）。中央气象台《大雾预警信号》以能见度 < 500 m / < 200 m / < 50 m 分别对应黄色 / 橙色 / 红色预警阈值，对应交通管制与作业停工等级。按 QX/T 113-2010《霾的观测和预报等级》：水平能见度 < 10 km、相对湿度 < 80%（且排除降水、沙尘暴等其他天气）时判识为霾，并按能见度细分为轻微（5–10 km）/ 轻度（3–5 km）/ 中度（2–3 km）/ 重度（< 2 km）霾。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["航行","驾驶","出行"],"keywords":["能见度","雾","霾","浓雾","强浓雾","大雾"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"《雾的预报等级 GB/T 27964-2011》、《霾的观测和预报等级 QX/T 113-2010》、《大雾预警信号》"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.1.0"}
{"id":"grading_temperature_high_warning","category":"grading_standard","topic":"高温分级","region":"CN","title":"高温与极端高温","content":"日最高气温 ≥ 35 ℃ 称高温日。中央气象台高温预警信号分三级：黄色预警——连续 3 天日最高气温将 ≥ 35 ℃；橙色预警——24 小时内最高气温将升至 ≥ 37 ℃；红色预警——24 小时内最高气温将升至 ≥ 40 ℃。劳动者应缩短户外作业时间，特别是 11:00–16:00 高温时段。","time_window":"日","applicable_scene":["施工","户外作业","健康"],"keywords":["高温","35度","37度","40度","高温预警","黄色预警","橙色预警","红色预警"],"source":{"org":"中国气象局","doc_title":"《气象灾害预警信号发布与传递办法》（高温预警信号）"},"confidence":"official","version":"1.1.0"}
{"id":"grading_humidity_comfort","category":"grading_standard","topic":"湿度舒适度","region":"common","title":"相对湿度舒适区间","content":"室内一般以相对湿度 40%–60% 最为舒适。低于 30% 偏干燥，高于 70% 偏闷热（夏季）或潮湿（冬季）。","time_window":"瞬时","applicable_scene":["生活","健康"],"keywords":["相对湿度","舒适","干燥","闷热"],"source":{"org":"通用常识","doc_title":"室内空气质量与人体舒适度参考"},"confidence":"common","version":"1.0.0"}
